1
00:00:10,040 --> 00:00:13,740
YAMU! YAMU! YAMU! YAMU! YAMU!

2
00:00:30,140 --> 00:00:31,500
Your moves!

3
00:01:03,540 --> 00:01:06,980
Now, then, we have some
catching up to do, haven't we?

4
00:01:07,220 --> 00:01:08,455
But we destroyed you.

5
00:01:08,680 --> 00:01:11,520
He regenerated himself. But how?

6
00:01:12,720 --> 00:01:15,073
Someone couldn't handle the competition.

7
00:01:15,460 --> 00:01:19,920
So I needed to step in and correct
that. I just needed... Let me guess.

8
00:01:20,160 --> 00:01:22,817
You just needed a little
more time, is that it?

9
00:01:22,900 --> 00:01:23,820
I was close.

10
00:01:24,800 --> 00:01:26,600
Yes, close to being defeated.

11
00:01:27,000 --> 00:01:29,357
Why don't you let me focus on the Pharaoh?

12
00:01:29,440 --> 00:01:31,640
You have other things to do,

13
00:01:31,940 --> 00:01:36,780
like convincing that son of yours to pledge
his allegiance to Zork, the Dark One.

14
00:01:37,080 --> 00:01:38,668
You mustn't listen to them.

15
00:01:38,920 --> 00:01:40,680
You belong with us, Seto.

16
00:01:41,140 --> 00:01:43,680
When the Age of Shadows is ushered in,

17
00:01:43,860 --> 00:01:46,625
a new king will be needed
to rule the darkness.

18
00:01:47,000 --> 00:01:49,120
Someone who possesses a great power.

19
00:01:50,440 --> 00:01:51,840
Someone like you!

20
00:01:57,860 --> 00:01:59,140
There is he.

21
00:02:03,560 --> 00:02:05,580
Seto, are you out there?

22
00:02:08,420 --> 00:02:13,880
You have been chosen to wield a power that
rivals that of the Egyptian God, Seto.

23
00:02:14,200 --> 00:02:15,030
What?

24
00:02:15,113 --> 00:02:16,437
What are you talking about?

25
00:02:16,520 --> 00:02:19,177
It looks like his majesty
is feeling threatened by

26
00:02:19,260 --> 00:02:22,380
the idea of being replaced
by someone more qualified.

27
00:02:22,920 --> 00:02:25,900
Someone who controls the
Blue Eyes, White Dragon.

28
00:02:28,040 --> 00:02:32,800
Kisara He needs that young
girl You knew about this?

29
00:02:33,180 --> 00:02:36,497
Yes Recently Seto and I
happened upon a peasant

30
00:02:36,580 --> 00:02:39,540
girl She held a power
like none I have ever seen

31
00:02:41,880 --> 00:02:44,880
Master Seto Wait, what's this?

32
00:02:45,140 --> 00:02:48,300
The power within her It's too strong

33
00:02:51,360 --> 00:02:55,000
Whoever this girl is She
possesses a powerful gift

34
00:02:55,720 --> 00:02:57,680
Or perhaps a powerful curse.

35
00:02:58,140 --> 00:03:01,493
Either way, this force mustn't
fall into the wrong hands.

36
00:03:01,920 --> 00:03:02,920
Or else what?

37
00:03:03,200 --> 00:03:06,318
You might lose your control
over the Egyptian people.

38
00:03:06,700 --> 00:03:07,530
Look,

39
00:03:07,640 --> 00:03:10,677
the fact remains that Zork is
about to resurrect at any moment,

40
00:03:10,760 --> 00:03:13,437
and there's nothing any
of you can do to stop him.

41
00:03:13,520 --> 00:03:16,777
Now let's see if Seto is intelligent
enough to take his father's

42
00:03:16,860 --> 00:03:20,440
advice and join the winning
side before the game is over.

43
00:03:22,960 --> 00:03:24,177
Listen to reason!

44
00:03:24,260 --> 00:03:27,937
If you side with the Pharaoh,
you'll be throwing away your future!

45
00:03:28,020 --> 00:03:28,850
Don't you see?

46
00:03:29,000 --> 00:03:31,860
You were born to be a
leader! You're right.

47
00:03:32,520 --> 00:03:33,980
Don't do this, Zeto!

48
00:03:34,800 --> 00:03:35,630
Silence!

49
00:03:35,820 --> 00:03:38,291
You have bigger things to worry about now!

50
00:03:40,360 --> 00:03:42,540
Diabound, strike down the Pharaoh!

51
00:03:49,440 --> 00:03:50,500
He's returned!

52
00:03:50,860 --> 00:03:51,777
This can't be!

53
00:03:51,860 --> 00:03:54,978
The Diabound stone tablet
has already been destroyed.

54
00:03:55,120 --> 00:03:56,480
You underestimate me.

55
00:03:56,800 --> 00:03:59,037
Now that I have all the Millennium Items,

56
00:03:59,120 --> 00:04:02,060
I no longer need a tablet
to summon Diabound.

57
00:04:02,360 --> 00:04:05,917
And with the power of these
treasures coursing through its veins,

58
00:04:06,000 --> 00:04:08,200
my Diabound is stronger than ever!

59
00:04:11,160 --> 00:04:14,680
Look into my eye and see your destiny.

60
00:04:15,360 --> 00:04:17,100
You shall be king.

61
00:04:17,420 --> 00:04:18,596
Don't listen to him.

62
00:04:18,740 --> 00:04:20,387
You know you belong with us.

63
00:04:21,860 --> 00:04:22,690
She's right.

64
00:04:22,980 --> 00:04:26,397
Seto, you're a member of the seven
sacred guardians of the Pharaoh.

65
00:04:26,480 --> 00:04:28,892
Don't you remember the vow that you took?

66
00:04:30,640 --> 00:04:33,420
If you accept the dark
power of the Shadows,

67
00:04:33,600 --> 00:04:36,894
you'll be making the same
mistake that your father made.

68
00:04:38,500 --> 00:04:39,920
Seto, wake up!

69
00:04:40,180 --> 00:04:41,592
They're controlling you!

70
00:04:45,220 --> 00:04:47,260
I've had enough of your meddling!

71
00:04:50,460 --> 00:04:51,290
Settle!

72
00:04:53,500 --> 00:04:54,560
Stop him!

73
00:04:57,580 --> 00:05:03,160
Sorry, Pharaoh, it's family only
Makura, what have you done with him?

74
00:05:03,640 --> 00:05:08,720
The same thing I'm about to do with
the stone Get it out of your reach

75
00:05:12,740 --> 00:05:14,560
No, the items

76
00:05:19,240 --> 00:05:23,460
Sorry, Pharoah, but I can't take
any more chances now, can I?

77
00:05:23,740 --> 00:05:25,960
Not with Zork's arrival so near.

78
00:05:29,920 --> 00:05:30,940
Now what?

79
00:05:31,600 --> 00:05:34,140
Now our shadow game is at a standstill,

80
00:05:34,420 --> 00:05:37,600
so we sit and wait for Zork
to arrive so I can win.

81
00:05:38,480 --> 00:05:43,009
And in the meantime, I've decided to
have a little fun with your game pieces.

82
00:05:43,960 --> 00:05:47,860
It seems to me that your Guardians
could use some time apart.

83
00:05:48,280 --> 00:05:50,515
What are you planning to do with them?

84
00:05:51,020 --> 00:05:53,500
Destroy them, one at a time.

85
00:05:58,840 --> 00:06:00,428
What's the meaning of this?

86
00:06:09,100 --> 00:06:12,100
We're going to play a little
game of hide and seek.

87
00:06:18,840 --> 00:06:21,060
I just had the weirdest dream.

88
00:06:32,340 --> 00:06:33,170
That's odd.

89
00:06:33,760 --> 00:06:36,140
Wait, maybe that wasn't a dream.

90
00:06:51,160 --> 00:06:52,160
Hold on!

91
00:06:52,440 --> 00:06:53,969
This place looks familiar!

92
00:06:58,700 --> 00:07:00,260
Great. So basically,

93
00:07:00,480 --> 00:07:02,697
I got knocked unconscious
and woke up in some

94
00:07:02,780 --> 00:07:05,960
oddball town that hasn't
changed in 5,000 years.

95
00:07:06,740 --> 00:07:08,960
Don't race into the Nile! Come on!

96
00:07:09,540 --> 00:07:11,140
You gotta head start!

97
00:07:15,920 --> 00:07:17,020
Hold down!

98
00:07:17,440 --> 00:07:19,322
I'm not even running my fastest!

99
00:07:21,320 --> 00:07:23,440
This doesn't make any sense!

100
00:07:24,920 --> 00:07:27,280
Those kids passed right through me!

101
00:07:27,580 --> 00:07:29,660
It's as if I don't exist here!

102
00:07:30,360 --> 00:07:31,190
Seto?

103
00:07:31,273 --> 00:07:32,120
Is that you?

104
00:07:37,020 --> 00:07:38,120
Hold on.

105
00:07:38,520 --> 00:07:40,100
You're not Seto?

106
00:07:42,200 --> 00:07:45,780
I mean, you look like him Wait,

107
00:07:46,120 --> 00:07:49,800
I know you You're that
girl I saw in my vision

108
00:07:54,820 --> 00:07:55,940
You're Kisara

109
00:07:56,940 --> 00:07:58,300
But who are you?

110
00:07:58,540 --> 00:08:01,097
And why are you dressed
in those strange clothes?

111
00:08:01,180 --> 00:08:04,557
First, I have some questions
for you Like, where are we?

112
00:08:04,640 --> 00:08:07,097
And why are you the
only one who can see me?

113
00:08:07,180 --> 00:08:10,980
An evil force is threatening
our land We must act quickly,

114
00:08:11,160 --> 00:08:12,748
or everything will be lost.

115
00:08:12,840 --> 00:08:14,605
You expect me to believe that?

116
00:08:14,760 --> 00:08:16,797
You can believe what you wish, sir.

117
00:08:16,880 --> 00:08:20,056
But the darkness is coming,
and I've got to warn Seto.

118
00:08:20,400 --> 00:08:21,518
Farewell, stranger.

119
00:08:26,080 --> 00:08:28,620
Looking for your friends? Yes.

120
00:08:28,880 --> 00:08:30,497
Tell me what you've done with them.

121
00:08:30,580 --> 00:08:33,280
I bought some time. Have a look.

122
00:08:33,540 --> 00:08:34,920
I'll clear the air.

123
00:08:37,740 --> 00:08:39,720
Master Mahad! Pharoah!

124
00:08:39,940 --> 00:08:41,040
Where are you?

125
00:08:43,640 --> 00:08:45,377
Master Shimon, are you all right?

126
00:08:45,460 --> 00:08:48,520
I'm fine, but where do you suppose we are?

127
00:08:52,460 --> 00:08:53,290
Akura!

128
00:08:53,373 --> 00:08:55,280
That's cheating! Not quite.

129
00:08:55,580 --> 00:08:57,345
I make the rules in this game.

130
00:08:57,500 --> 00:08:59,577
And this is the part where
we wait for the Great

131
00:08:59,660 --> 00:09:02,440
Zop to resurrect and
watch your friends squirm.

132
00:09:02,680 --> 00:09:03,980
So enjoy the show.

133
00:09:04,920 --> 00:09:09,780
i won't let you win i'm
afraid i already have

134
00:09:14,180 --> 00:09:18,437
how'd i get out here so weird

135
00:09:18,520 --> 00:09:21,480
i wonder where everyone else is

136
00:09:26,660 --> 00:09:30,980
i smell trouble now i hear trouble

137
00:09:33,620 --> 00:09:38,080
According to Bobasa, the pharaoh's
real name is hidden somewhere in there.

138
00:09:38,360 --> 00:09:40,242
Well, then, let's head in, guys.

139
00:09:40,880 --> 00:09:42,580
I say, ladies first.

140
00:09:42,860 --> 00:09:45,213
Oh, so now you decide to be a gentleman.

141
00:09:45,300 --> 00:09:47,712
I promise we won't let you down, pharaoh.

142
00:09:49,840 --> 00:09:52,320
So, uh, did anyone bring a flashlight?

143
00:09:55,060 --> 00:09:56,880
Mahat, any sign of the others?

144
00:09:57,480 --> 00:09:59,068
Unfortunately not, my king.

145
00:09:59,620 --> 00:10:00,450
Very well.

146
00:10:00,533 --> 00:10:01,814
That can't be too far.

147
00:10:02,420 --> 00:10:06,538
I'm sure separating us is all part
of Bakura's plan to stall for time.

148
00:10:07,860 --> 00:10:11,337
Yes, but I have a feeling he's
doing more than just waiting.

149
00:10:11,420 --> 00:10:14,577
If I know Bakura, he's planning
to weaken our defenses.

150
00:10:14,660 --> 00:10:17,900
So when Zork arrives,
he'll be unstoppable.

151
00:10:20,140 --> 00:10:21,420
Do you hear that?

152
00:10:22,100 --> 00:10:24,060
I do. What is it?

153
00:10:25,200 --> 00:10:27,277
Egypt's most devastating predator.

154
00:10:27,360 --> 00:10:28,760
Oh, no!

155
00:10:32,000 --> 00:10:32,830
Hello?

156
00:10:32,913 --> 00:10:33,743
Anyone there?

157
00:10:38,300 --> 00:10:39,560
Sorry, I asked!

158
00:10:44,520 --> 00:10:45,720
Where are we?

159
00:10:46,180 --> 00:10:48,298
Kareem, thank goodness you're awake.

160
00:10:48,560 --> 00:10:49,913
But how is the pharaoh?

161
00:10:50,180 --> 00:10:52,239
You must make sure he is all right.

162
00:10:52,780 --> 00:10:55,040
I am not going to leave you.

163
00:10:55,680 --> 00:10:59,400
Look, Isis, I barely have enough
energy to summon a monster.

164
00:11:00,040 --> 00:11:02,340
I'm of no use to you right now.

165
00:11:02,640 --> 00:11:03,537
But, Kareem...

166
00:11:03,620 --> 00:11:06,660
Please, it is your duty
to protect our king.

167
00:11:13,500 --> 00:11:14,760
What's the problem?

168
00:11:15,160 --> 00:11:17,460
Am I starting to bug you?

169
00:11:21,140 --> 00:11:22,480
Magical Orb, attack!

170
00:11:36,040 --> 00:11:38,460
There are thousands of them.

171
00:11:38,920 --> 00:11:40,040
Be gone!

172
00:11:43,940 --> 00:11:47,940
One by one, your precious gate
pieces are being crushed, Pharaoh.

173
00:11:48,420 --> 00:11:49,840
I'm running out of time.

174
00:11:50,260 --> 00:11:53,677
As Pakora's hourglass counts
down to the destruction of Egypt,

175
00:11:53,760 --> 00:11:55,620
My guardians grow weaker.

176
00:11:55,900 --> 00:11:59,135
Before long, he'll have
succeeded in rewriting history.

177
00:11:59,780 --> 00:12:00,680
Oh, well.

178
00:12:01,120 --> 00:12:04,473
If only you could remember a
little more about your past.

179
00:12:05,780 --> 00:12:08,780
Then you might know how
you beat me the first time.

180
00:12:08,900 --> 00:12:11,860
But no, you had to go and
erase your own memory,

181
00:12:12,280 --> 00:12:15,809
giving me the chance to do what
I should have done ages ago.

182
00:12:16,340 --> 00:12:17,340
Destroy you.

183
00:12:28,980 --> 00:12:31,877
mana it looks like your
friend could use some

184
00:12:31,960 --> 00:12:34,720
help too bad there's
no one around for miles

185
00:12:36,920 --> 00:12:39,740
think you're so tough well check this out

186
00:12:41,500 --> 00:12:46,777
well done as if that's
going to help please she's

187
00:12:46,860 --> 00:12:50,960
just wasting her time and
my time just take a Look,

188
00:12:51,340 --> 00:12:53,757
your pathetic guardians
are even more pathetic

189
00:12:53,840 --> 00:12:56,487
now that I've isolated
them from one another.

190
00:12:56,640 --> 00:13:01,500
The only question is, who will lose
their soul to the shadows first?

191
00:13:02,100 --> 00:13:02,940
Any guesses?

192
00:13:03,540 --> 00:13:05,560
Come on, it's a game.

193
00:13:05,900 --> 00:13:07,547
You should try and have fun.

194
00:13:11,940 --> 00:13:13,880
Two-headed jackal warrior!

195
00:13:14,600 --> 00:13:15,860
Come forth!

196
00:13:23,600 --> 00:13:26,040
Well done, Shaddaa. Thank you.

197
00:13:26,240 --> 00:13:30,200
But I fear you and I are not
the only ones under attack. Yes.

198
00:13:30,500 --> 00:13:32,060
Let us find the Pharaoh.

199
00:13:32,700 --> 00:13:33,530
Go ahead.

200
00:13:33,613 --> 00:13:34,443
I dare you.

201
00:13:34,900 --> 00:13:37,547
Those pawns of yours
don't know when to quit.

202
00:13:37,740 --> 00:13:40,480
They're friends, not pawns. Of course.

203
00:13:40,800 --> 00:13:42,580
How very insensitive of me.

204
00:13:42,760 --> 00:13:44,580
I forgot how much you care.

205
00:13:46,540 --> 00:13:47,560
It's remarkable.

206
00:13:47,880 --> 00:13:50,677
You don't remember the first
thing about these people.

207
00:13:50,760 --> 00:13:55,800
Yet somehow, you feel compelled to call
these virtual strangers your friends.

208
00:13:56,160 --> 00:13:58,120
My advice is let them go.

209
00:13:58,540 --> 00:14:00,300
You wouldn't understand it.

210
00:14:00,480 --> 00:14:02,774
You've never had a friend in your life.

211
00:14:03,020 --> 00:14:08,920
I may not remember them, but there is a
bond between us that's lasted 5,000 years.

212
00:14:09,220 --> 00:14:11,102
A bond that can never be broken.

213
00:14:13,040 --> 00:14:13,870
Never.

214
00:14:24,500 --> 00:14:26,380
No, please, Isis.

215
00:14:35,100 --> 00:14:38,300
Two-headed jackal warrior.
Are you all right?

216
00:14:39,680 --> 00:14:41,180
Isis! It's us.

217
00:14:42,220 --> 00:14:44,300
You arrived just in time.

218
00:14:44,500 --> 00:14:45,382
Where's Kareem?

219
00:14:50,760 --> 00:14:53,995
You three are here, then who
is protecting the Pharaoh?

220
00:14:54,200 --> 00:14:56,280
Don't worry, we shall find him.

221
00:14:58,060 --> 00:15:00,860
Shaddaa, please take
what is left of my power.

222
00:15:01,400 --> 00:15:02,360
No, wait.

223
00:15:02,660 --> 00:15:07,420
Please, before I enter the Shadow Realm,
I want the Pharaoh to have my strength.

224
00:15:08,380 --> 00:15:09,240
Very well.

225
00:15:10,540 --> 00:15:11,420
Thank you.

226
00:15:27,080 --> 00:15:30,260
Kareem, your strength
may have saved our king.

227
00:15:35,200 --> 00:15:36,960
This ends now!

228
00:15:38,700 --> 00:15:41,440
Jackal Warrior, time to finish him off!

229
00:15:53,980 --> 00:15:54,810
Shadda!

230
00:15:56,400 --> 00:15:57,230
Pharaoh!

231
00:15:59,720 --> 00:16:01,000
He's all right.

232
00:16:01,580 --> 00:16:04,480
My king, I know you'll defeat Bakura.

233
00:16:05,500 --> 00:16:08,680
And the darkness over
Egypt will be no more.

234
00:16:09,620 --> 00:16:11,940
Yes, and you'll return.

235
00:16:12,340 --> 00:16:15,880
Until then, I wish you
all the best of luck.

236
00:16:16,300 --> 00:16:17,535
Farewell, my friends.

237
00:16:18,380 --> 00:16:19,210
Farewell.

238
00:16:21,840 --> 00:16:22,670
Kareem...

239
00:16:23,600 --> 00:16:25,140
I've seen enough.

240
00:16:27,980 --> 00:16:28,810
Pharoah!

241
00:16:32,920 --> 00:16:35,240
Time to put an end to this madness.

242
00:16:36,260 --> 00:16:38,760
Hassan, stay here and protect the others.

243
00:16:39,040 --> 00:16:40,511
I'm going to find Settle.

244
00:16:41,980 --> 00:16:46,380
I won't allow another friend to
fall victim to the shadows, Pharoah.

245
00:16:46,960 --> 00:16:50,600
If that is your wish,
then I shall obey my king.

246
00:16:51,800 --> 00:16:52,657
That is my wish.

247
00:16:52,740 --> 00:16:54,380
Stay strong, my friends.

248
00:17:16,380 --> 00:17:18,117
There's only one way to find out.

249
00:17:18,200 --> 00:17:19,030
Joey, wait!

250
00:17:19,113 --> 00:17:20,280
It's not that easy!

251
00:17:23,320 --> 00:17:27,217
Did I mention that this place is loaded
with traps to keep out intruders?

252
00:17:27,300 --> 00:17:29,065
You could have told me sooner!

253
00:17:29,580 --> 00:17:33,237
Did he happen to mention how we're
supposed to get through this thing?

254
00:17:33,320 --> 00:17:34,150
Yep.

255
00:17:34,233 --> 00:17:36,415
I just hope I can remember everything.

256
00:17:37,300 --> 00:17:38,130
All right.

257
00:17:38,280 --> 00:17:40,517
So what did your gramps
say about this maze?

258
00:17:40,600 --> 00:17:42,247
Well, you see those statues?

259
00:17:42,540 --> 00:17:45,140
They're kind of like robots. Right.

260
00:17:45,440 --> 00:17:47,040
Ancient Egyptian robots.

261
00:17:47,300 --> 00:17:48,476
I should have known.

262
00:17:48,560 --> 00:17:52,148
He also said that whoever enters
needs to show their respect,

263
00:17:52,520 --> 00:17:54,638
just like the ancient Egyptians did.

264
00:17:55,700 --> 00:17:58,057
Take a look at how these
statues are standing.

265
00:17:58,140 --> 00:18:00,258
See how their left feet are forward?

266
00:18:00,620 --> 00:18:01,520
Know why?

267
00:18:01,760 --> 00:18:05,957
In the old days, pointing your foot
towards the Pharaoh was a sign of respect.

268
00:18:06,040 --> 00:18:07,099
What's your point?

269
00:18:07,320 --> 00:18:10,860
I guess we should move with our
left foot forward. I get it.

270
00:18:11,080 --> 00:18:12,668
Just walk like an Egyptian.

271
00:18:17,240 --> 00:18:19,440
This must be the final test.

272
00:18:19,920 --> 00:18:21,480
What happens here?

273
00:18:22,120 --> 00:18:23,920
If I remember the story right,

274
00:18:24,280 --> 00:18:27,777
each one of these stone tablets
has a monster living inside.

275
00:18:27,860 --> 00:18:30,500
And if they sense fear, they'll attack.

276
00:18:31,520 --> 00:18:33,420
Did Gramps mention a shortcut?

277
00:18:33,760 --> 00:18:36,560
Yeah, and preferably one without monsters.

278
00:18:36,980 --> 00:18:38,392
Ringing any bells, Yugi?

279
00:18:40,020 --> 00:18:42,957
Yugi! Careful! Don't worry!

280
00:18:43,040 --> 00:18:45,334
They'll only attack if they sense fear.

281
00:18:45,520 --> 00:18:48,057
And with the fate of the
whole world depending on us,

282
00:18:48,140 --> 00:18:49,964
I don't have time to be scared.

283
00:18:50,080 --> 00:18:52,340
You know what I mean, right? No clue.

284
00:18:52,640 --> 00:18:55,860
But as always, we're right
behind you, Yug. Yeah!

285
00:19:06,580 --> 00:19:09,557
This must be where Grandpa
found the Millennium Puzzle.

286
00:19:09,640 --> 00:19:11,405
Uh, there's nothing here, pal.

287
00:19:12,080 --> 00:19:15,198
Maybe that writing carved
on the wall has some clues.

288
00:19:15,880 --> 00:19:17,440
There's only one problem.

289
00:19:17,700 --> 00:19:19,880
This Egyptian is all Greek to me.

290
00:19:20,460 --> 00:19:21,440
Now what?

291
00:19:22,120 --> 00:19:23,300
I'm not sure.

292
00:19:23,760 --> 00:19:27,117
Maybe there's another room
that even Gramps couldn't find.

293
00:19:27,200 --> 00:19:29,180
Yeah, but good luck finding it.

294
00:19:33,540 --> 00:19:35,300
What? No way!

295
00:19:36,440 --> 00:19:37,677
We found it!

296
00:19:37,760 --> 00:19:38,800
Excellent.

297
00:19:39,300 --> 00:19:42,320
Too bad these fools will
never see what's inside.
